# The cut of PodUtils/podnet#447 (podnet's answer to GitHub #67,
# COORD-042): the sans-IO parts. wg.rs: the primitives (BLAKE2s, HMAC, the
# KDF, X25519, ChaCha20-Poly1305, TAI64N), Keys, Initiation (initiate,
# initiate_with, finish), mac1, Session with Replay, and the timers of State
# (rekey, and the keepalive of WgKeepalive::run) as Tunnel on the caller's
